## 🔗 RELATED POSTS

### **Related-posts tagien perusteella; OG-kuva artikkelille** (Related posts based on tags; OG image for articles)

### **Related Posts Algorithm**
```typescript
// lib/blog/getRelatedPosts.ts
export function getRelatedPosts(currentPost: BlogPost, allPosts: BlogPost[], maxPosts: number = 3): BlogPost[] {
  const { tags, slug, locale } = currentPost;
  
  // Filter posts by same locale and exclude current post
  const candidatePosts = allPosts.filter(post => 
    post.locale === locale && post.slug !== slug
  );
  
  // Calculate relevance score based on tag overlap
  const postsWithScores = candidatePosts.map(post => {
    const commonTags = tags.filter(tag => post.tags.includes(tag));
    const score = commonTags.length;
    
    return { post, score, commonTags };
  });
  
  // Sort by relevance score and return top posts
  return postsWithScores
    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)
    .slice(0, maxPosts)
    .map(item => item.post);
}
```

### **Related Posts Component**
```tsx
// components/blog/RelatedPosts.tsx
interface RelatedPostsProps {
  posts: BlogPost[];
  currentSlug: string;
}

export function RelatedPosts({ posts, currentSlug }: RelatedPostsProps) {
  const relatedPosts = getRelatedPosts(
    { slug: currentSlug, tags: [], locale: 'en' },
    posts,
    3
  );
  
  if (relatedPosts.length === 0) return null;
  
  return (
    <section className="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-lightGray">
      <h3 className="font-playfair text-2xl text-forest mb-6">
        Related articles
      </h3>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {relatedPosts.map(post => (
          <RelatedPostCard key={post.slug} post={post} />
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}
```

### **OG Image Generation**
```typescript
// lib/blog/generateOGImage.ts
export function generateOGImage(frontmatter: BlogFrontmatter): string {
  const { title, heroImage } = frontmatter;
  
  // Use hero image if available, otherwise generate dynamic OG image
  if (heroImage) {
    return `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL}${heroImage}`;
  }
  
  // Generate dynamic OG image with title
  return `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL}/api/og?title=${encodeURIComponent(title)}`;
}
```

## 📅 DATE HANDLING

### **Älä hallusinoi päiviä, vaan käytä päivämääränä aina deployment-päivää** (Don't hallucinate dates, but use deployment date as the date)

### **Date Implementation**
```typescript
// lib/blog/getDeploymentDate.ts
export function getDeploymentDate(): string {
  // Use deployment date from environment variable
  const deploymentDate = process.env.DEPLOYMENT_DATE;
  
  if (deploymentDate) {
    return new Date(deploymentDate).toISOString();
  }
  
  // Fallback to current date (for development)
  return new Date().toISOString();
}

// Usage in blog post creation
export function createBlogPost(frontmatter: Partial<BlogFrontmatter>): BlogFrontmatter {
  return {
    ...frontmatter,
    date: getDeploymentDate(), // Always use deployment date
    // ... other required fields
  };
}
```

### **Date Validation**
```typescript
// Ensure dates are not in the future
export function validateDate(dateString: string): boolean {
  const postDate = new Date(dateString);
  const now = new Date();
  
  // Post date should not be in the future
  if (postDate > now) {
    console.warn(`Post date ${dateString} is in the future. Using current date.`);
    return false;
  }
  
  return true;
}
```

